About Us:
Started as a project to support my wife's events. She was organizing an annual
Indian food festival in town. At the end of one of the  events, I was shocked to
see the amount of fees she had to pay to the event website where she hosted the event.
The idea came to me to setup a way for her to host events using a custom portal
connected to her website. The idea was to only support this annual event for tickets
and scanning. About a few months in, the software architect in me kicked in to expand this
to a platform accessible to all. That really expanded the scope of the project but
I am glad it did. I have gone through a journey that has taught me so much about software development,
infrastructure, and managing costs like nothing could.



